/// [Holdings] A debit or credit card linked to an account. Frontier Rhea's credit card card-rhea-frontier is temporarily locked after a dispute. Only masked numbers exist. Credit limit is not cash. Standards: BIAN 13.0.0 Credit Card (custom), Customer Product and Service Directory (custom); Microsoft CDM FICard (semantic reference only). Demo mapping, not certification. Star role: dimension; grain: one card. Lakehouse: dim_card <- silver_card <- cards.json. Official CDM name aliases: FICard.integrationKey, FICard.cardnumber, FICard.purchasingLimit (semantic reference only).
entity Card
	lineageTag: 39a1515c-66b3-5c56-bad5-203ed3c733d9
	backingTable: Card
	keyProperty: CardId

